      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غوّط</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَغْوِيطٌ</span>, <i>He gobbled</i> [food]:
(Ibn-'Abbád, O, K: *) or <i>gobbled largely,</i> or <i>in
large mouthfuls:</i> (K, * TA:) from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَوْطٌ</span> meaning
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَرِيد</span>. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَغْوِيطٌ</span> signifies also The
<i>making</i> a well <i>deep.</i> (K. [See also 4.])

